stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Waiting: live or catch-up receives message
    Waiting --> Queued: actor commits message ticket and original
    Queued --> Queued: other path resumes the stored original
    Queued --> Delivered: owner submits and settles once
    Delivered --> Delivered: restart preserves committed ticket
    Delivered --> Delivered: retry recognizes committed ticket
    Delivered --> FalseWarning: before repair, retry hashes a rebuilt original
